# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# v2.0 Complete P&C Vault Command & Passcode Parser (Zero-Plaintext)
# Handles:
#   - Direct passcode: Primary / Legacy commitments, formatted variants, '#1'
#   - Keyed passcode : 'pass: <code>', 'password is <code>', 'pin <code>', etc.
#   - One-shot P&Cs  : 'open vault : <code>', 'open the vault : <code>',
#                      'unlock/launch/enter/access/start [the] vault/lockerdrive <code>',
#                      '<code> open vault'
#   - Two-step P&Cs  : 'open [the] vault' -> asks for password -> <code>
#   - One-shot wrong : 'open vault : 123456' -> counts wrong try & awaits retry
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

