    "ok thats 3 wrong ones lol, im closing the vault 🚫 ask me again in a minute!!",
    "3 strikes!! vault game over 😂 come back in like 60s (or play an actual game 🎮)",
    "nope nope n nope!! vault closed for u, 1 min cooldown lol ⏳",
